      "message": "no, you are not blind, thanks for reading it so thoroughly! :)\nWithout over-explaining it: for reviewers it is good to see that the backports were cherry picked branch by branch, seeing all the previous cherry picks (random example [1]). You are right, in this case, as there is no difference in the patch against zed compared to master version, it is not a big deal. Also, I\u0027m aware that not all project requires to strictly do the cherry picks branch by branch, hence it is just a nit. Sorry for wasting your time.\n\n[1] https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/nova/+/882920/1//COMMIT_MSG",
